    "html": "Hello BBC Choir!<p><b><u>\"Thanks\" for Thanksgiving&nbsp;Sunday, Nov. 22</u></b></p><p>The link to the song that we started at last night's practice called \"Thanks\" is contained in the Songs section materials.</p><p>The SATB arrangement that I wrote is based on this recording with a few modifications.&nbsp; Listening to this recording will help you absorb the overall feeling/tempo, etc.</p><p>\"Thanks\" for listening.</p><p>Thank you for your faithfulness!<br></p>",
